{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Three Cardinals</strong> is a short, nonlinear exploration game integrating rhythm-game elements to enhance character movement. You play as Mother Cardinal and explore 3 distinct regions to find your chicks since they recently moved out of the family nest\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.poster.avif?t=1754054525\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.webm?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.mp4?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> scenic landscapes inspired by Quebec\u2019s wilderness: from the Northern Cliffs\u2019 golden woods to the Eastern Bay\u2019s rocky beaches\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.poster.avif?t=1754054525\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.webm?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.mp4?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLY AND SING</strong> using simple controls. Feel like going a little faster? As you fly, press \u201cSpace Bar\u201d to the music\u2019s melody and boost your speed! Later, upgrade this ability by finding each of the three cardinal\u2019s instruments\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.poster.avif?t=1754054525\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.webm?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.mp4?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE FRIENDS</strong> with over 50 unique characters! Whether you\u2019re looking to test your flying skills in a race with J\u00e9, the blue jay, or crack the case on the Eastern Bay\u2019s latest mystery with Sullivan, the snowy owl, there\u2019s always a new friend around the corner to speak to\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.poster.avif?t=1754054525\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.webm?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.mp4?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT ITEMS</strong> and use them to craft new furniture for your chicks when they come back home! A couple pebbles and twigs could be used to make a pebble-bath and branch-couch\u2026 or maybe you could find a stranger willing to exchange these materials for a pet bumblebee!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865990?t=1754054525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/ba00bc1f09c5edbce1feb8d75204fd439db00b7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754054525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/06191a8ce7e9ed5d9ca0d7a8ce098a7fbcb801b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754054525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/06191a8ce7e9ed5d9ca0d7a8ce098a7fbcb801b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754054525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Three Cardinals</strong> is a short, nonlinear exploration game integrating rhythm-game elements to enhance character movement. You play as Mother Cardinal and explore 3 distinct regions to find your chicks since they recently moved out of the family nest\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.poster.avif?t=1754054525\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.webm?t=1754054525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic